  "description": "SpawnDev's fork of SIPSorceryMedia.Abstractions. Namespace (SIPSorceryMedia.*) and AssemblyName (SIPSorceryMedia.Abstractions) unchanged from upstream - drop-in compatible. Tracks upstream main branch code ahead of the 8.0.12 public nuget.org release (needed because SpawnDev.SIPSorcery uses codecs like AV1 that are only in post-8.0.12 upstream commits).",
